YANI: Skinning Kit. Allows you to skin corpses to get a 'Foo hide' (or in
the case of dragons, Scales). The hide would have a base AC depending on
whether it's a thick skinned monster or not (thick skinned have same AC as
a studded leather armour, thin skinned have same AC as a leather jacket).
The hides wouldn't affect spellcasting. Some monsters can not be skinned
(I'm thinking really small ones, but there may be some others). The corpse
would be used up in the process.

Dragon scales would no longer be dropped by dragons, which makes it harder
to get DSM in a wishless game as you have to find a skinning kit first.

And bragging rights go to the first person to ascend wearing a blessed
fireproof +5 Wizard of Yendor Hide.

I'm beginning to really like this idea. If only I could code...


